+# Implementation Plan: JSON Patch
+
+**Spec**: [spec.md](spec.md)
+
+## Summary
+New module `src/patch.ts` exporting `applyPatch`, re-exported from `src/index.ts`. Deep-clone the document, apply each operation to the clone using `parsePointer` from `src/pointer.ts`.
+
+## Constitution Check
+Constitution is an unfilled template: no rules to violate. Behaviour follows RFC 6902.
+
+## Decisions
+- Clone with `structuredClone`; values from the patch are cloned when inserted.
+- Members set via `Object.defineProperty` to be safe with `__proto__`.
+- Root removal throws.
